  m_Name: Evento_CidadeViraModeloExportadoDeGestaoUrbana
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Cidade Vira Modelo Exportado de Gest\xE3o Urbana"
  _titleEn: City Becomes an Exported Model of Urban Management
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Cidades que resolvem bem um problema viram refer\xEAncia e recebem visitas,
    pr\xEAmios e parcerias."
  _summaryEn: Cities that solve a problem well become a reference and receive visits,
    awards and partnerships.
  _realWorld: "Medell\xEDn inaugurou em 2004 o Metrocable, telef\xE9rico integrado
    ao metr\xF4 que liga bairros pobres nas encostas, e virou exemplo mundial de
    urbanismo social."
  _realWorldEn: "Medell\xEDn opened the Metrocable in 2004, a cable car integrated
    with the metro connecting poor hillside neighborhoods, and became a global example
    of social urbanism."
  _tradeOffs: "Solu\xE7\xF5es copiadas sem adaptar ao contexto local costumam dar
    errado."
  _tradeOffsEn: Solutions copied without adapting to local context often fail.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Metrocable (Medell\xEDn) (Wikipedia)"
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metrocable_(Medell%C3%ADn)
